---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title="Privacy — DekhoYahan" description="DekhoYahan privacy information.">
  <section class="content-page shell">
    <p class="section-kicker">Privacy</p>
    <h1>Privacy, in plain English.</h1>

    <div class="prose">
      <p>We want DekhoYahan to be simple to visit and simple to understand.</p>

      <h2>What we collect</h2>
      <p>You do not need an account to use DekhoYahan right now. We do not ask for personal information just to read the site.</p>
      <p>Our hosting and security providers may process normal technical information needed to deliver the website, such as IP addresses, browser information, request logs and security signals.</p>

      <h2>Cookies and advertising</h2>
      <p>We are not currently using advertising cookies or selling personal information.</p>

      <h2>If this changes</h2>
      <p>If we later add analytics, accounts, community features or other services that change how information is handled, we will update this page and explain it clearly.</p>

      <h2>Questions</h2>
      <p>Email us at <a href="mailto:hello@dekhoyahan.com">hello@dekhoyahan.com</a>.</p>
      <p><strong>Last updated:</strong> 12 August 2026</p>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
